GENERAL / PLAYER COMMANDS

!bothelp / !h — show this command list
!register / !reg — register yourself and get a starting Elo
!recent — show the last 5 recorded matches
!nickname <nickname> — set your own display nickname
!nickname <user> <nickname> — (mod/admin) set another player's nickname

LOBBY COMMANDS

!join / !j — join the lobby (already in? !j refreshes your spot so you aren't dropped for inactivity)
!leave / !l — leave the lobby
!lobby — show current lobby members

CAPTAIN DRAFT COMMANDS

!captain — claim a captain slot (must be in the lobby)
!uncaptain / !drop — give up your captain slot
!captains — list current captains
!pass — (Captain A only, before any pick) pass first pick to Captain B
!draft <player> / !d <player> — pick a player for your team (your turn only)

PREFERENCE COMMANDS

!prefs — show your faction preferences
!prefs show — show your faction preferences
!prefs @user — show another player's faction preferences
!prefs clear — clear your faction preferences
!prefs add <Faction> — add a faction to your preferences
!prefs remove <Faction> — remove a faction from your preferences
!prefs <Faction1> <Faction2> ... — set your full preference list

FACTION ASSIGNMENT COMMANDS (manual modes)

!assignf <player> <faction> — assign a faction to a player on your team
!assignfactions <bulk text> — bulk-assign factions for your team
!lockfactions — lock in your team's faction assignments

DRAFT MODE COMMANDS

!mode — show the current draft mode
!mode show — show the current draft mode
!mode auto — AutoDraft, Auto Faction
!mode auto-manual — AutoDraft, Manual Faction
!mode captain — Captain Draft, Manual Faction
!mode captain-auto — Captain Draft, Auto Faction

(Mode changes require a captain or admin/mod.)

GAME & SCORE COMMANDS

!games / !g — list ongoing games
!score 1 — vote for Team A win
!score 0 — vote for Team B win
!scores — show score voting summary for your game
!forcescore <scoreA> <scoreB> — (mod or captain) force-set the result of your game
!forcescore <gameId> <scoreA> <scoreB> — same, when multiple games are ongoing
!kill — (mod/admin) terminate the ongoing game with no Elo changes
!kill <gameId> — same, when multiple games are ongoing

STATS COMMANDS

!stats — your season stats
!stats <user> — season stats for a player
!stats lifetime — your lifetime stats
!stats <user> lifetime — lifetime stats for a player
!leaderboard / !top — season leaderboard (top 10)
!leaderboard <count> / !top <count> — season leaderboard (custom size)
!leaderboard lifetime — lifetime leaderboard
!compare <user1> <user2> — season comparison
!compare <user1> <user2> lifetime — lifetime comparison

SEASON COMMANDS

!season — show the current season
!season history — list all recorded seasons
!season show <n> — show details for season <n>
!season summary — current season highlights (top Elo, best winrate, etc.)
!season showleaderboard <n> — Elo leaderboard for season <n>
!season start — (mod/admin) end the current season and start a new one

MODERATION COMMANDS (mod/admin only)

!warn <user> <reason> — warn a player
!warns <user> — list a player's active warnings
!removewarn <user> <index> — remove a warning by index
!ban <user> <reason> — ban a player
!unban <user> — unban a player

ADMIN COMMANDS (admin only)

!addadmin <@mention or userId> — grant admin
!removeadmin <@mention or userId> — revoke admin
!addmod <@mention or userId> — grant moderator
!removemod <@mention or userId> — revoke moderator
!admins — list admins
!mods — list moderators

DEBUG COMMANDS (mod/admin only)

!debugfill — fill the lobby with dummy players
!debugstart <gameId> — force-start a game
!debugclear <gameId> — clear a game's state
!debugcaptains <gameId> — show captain draft debug info
!debugdraft <gameId> — show draft debug info
!debugfactions <gameId> — show faction assignment debug info
!debugstate <gameId> — show full game state
